sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client agent
    participant D as Discovery<br/>/.well-known/agent.json
    participant S as TYPO3 A2A server<br/>a2a_rpc
    participant X as Specialist skill
    C->>D: GET agent card
    D-->>C: skills, transport, auth
    C->>S: JSON-RPC message/send
    S-->>C: task: submitted
    S->>X: route by skill
    S-->>C: status: working
    X-->>S: artifact chunks
    S-->>C: artifact + status: completed
